[38;2;124;124;124mWe claim that every plane λ in R³ meets M in a finite nonempty set.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mA plane λ in R³ is given by an equation ax + by + cz = d, where (a, b, c) ≠ (0, [0m[38;2;124;124;124m0, 0).[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mA point (t, t³, t⁵) ∈ M lies on λ if and only if:[0m
[38;2;124;124;124mat⁵ + bt³ + ct = d[0m

